---
import styles from "./faq.module.css";
---

<section class={styles.root} aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <h2 id="faq-title" class={styles.title}>Common questions</h2>
  <div class={styles.list}>
    <div class={styles.item}>
      <h3 class={styles.question}>Is Underpressured free and open source?</h3>
      <p class={styles.answer}>
        Yes. Underpressured is free and open source.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles.item}>
      <h3 class={styles.question}>Which languages does the app support?</h3>
      <p class={styles.answer}>
        The app supports English, Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, German, French, Arabic, Japanese,
        and Simplified Chinese.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles.item}>
      <h3 class={styles.question}>Which Mac does it require?</h3>
      <p class={styles.answer}>
        Underpressured requires a Mac with Apple Silicon and macOS 27 or later.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles.item}>
      <h3 class={styles.question}>Is Underpressured available now?</h3>
      <p class={styles.answer}>Not yet. It is coming soon for Mac.</p>
    </div>
    <div class={styles.item}>
      <h3 class={styles.question}>Where can I read about the benchmarks?</h3>
      <p class={styles.answer}>
        The <a class={styles.link} href="/benchmarks/">benchmarks page</a> explains the test setup,
        results, and limits.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
